  "method": "One piecewise anatomical coordinate map is applied to all composed meshes and the existing 65-bone rest skeleton. Deviations from the source body are deliberately small (shoulders/hips within about +-10%, belly/neck/stoop bounded, no caricature facial scaling); char_shapes.check_proportions rejects any build outside the human anthropometric envelope recorded in char_compatibility.json. Head size is absolute (char_compatibility anthropometry.headHeight, solved per profile); \"head\" is only a tweak multiplier. Hands carry a source-family correction (bodies[].handScale).",
